      DESCRIBE
BIRDS -- THE COMBINATORS APL\360 CAN WRITE, AFTER THE BIRDS OF
SMULLYAN'S TO MOCK A MOCKINGBIRD. HOWBIRDS SHOWS THEM ALL.

ON VALUES, WHICH APL\360 CAN WRITE IN GENERAL:
   I X         IDIOT      X
   X K Y       KESTREL    X, IGNORING Y
   X KI Y      KITE       Y, IGNORING X

OVER A FIXED TABLE OF PRIMITIVES, EACH NAMED BY ITS GLYPH:
   X T F       THRUSH     F X
   FG B X      BLUEBIRD   F G X
   F C Y Z     CARDINAL   Z F Y
   F W X       WARBLER    X F X
   FG S X      STARLING   X F G X

   F APPLY X   THE MONADIC PRIMITIVE WHOSE GLYPH IS F, ON X
   X DYAD Y    X FN Y, FOR THE GLYPH IN THE CALLER'S FN

NOTHERE SAYS WHICH BIRDS ARE MISSING, AND WHY.
      ⍝ Every bird, flying.
